          "S15",
          "S05"
        ],
        "alternative": "frontend_warning"
      },
      {
        "id": "F07",
        "claim": "Host CPU saturation is ruled out. cpu_percent on checkout-api-3 ranged from 25.5% to 35.9% across 09:13\u201309:25, with only a slight rise during the incident. The failing requests spent their time waiting on DB pool acquisition and gateway I/O, not on compute.",
        "source_ids": [
